<title>UK: BOE allots 440 mln stg in outright bills, repos.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 440 mln stg in outright bills, repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it allotted 440 million stg in outright bills and repos.</p>
<p>It allotted 430 million stg in repos maturing on July 30 at a rate of 6.75 percent and 430 million stg in outright bills maturing on July 30.</p>
<p>The Bank forecasts the liquidity shortage at 1.150 bln stg, before any assistance.</p>
</text>
